---
title: Request Flow — unstructured text to three explained offers
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant UI as Operator Console
    participant ORC as Orchestrator
    participant EX as Intent Extractor
    participant VF as Constraint Verifier
    participant RS as Schedule Reasoner
    participant XP as Explainer
    participant LLM as Claude API
    participant TS as TraceSink

    UI->>ORC: "Can I come in next Thursday after 3?"
    ORC->>TS: span open

    ORC->>EX: extract(text, patient, NOW)
    alt live model call within timeout — the default
        EX->>LLM: claude-opus-5, structured output
        LLM-->>EX: typed fields + confidence + source spans
        EX-->>ORC: RequestConstraints
    else timeout, schema violation, refusal, or no key
        ORC->>EX: committed fixtures, then deterministic rules
        EX-->>ORC: RequestConstraints, fallback_fired
    end

    ORC->>VF: verify against the world, not the schedule
    Note over VF: rules run first as the floor —<br/>the model may add a flag, never remove one
    alt live model call within timeout — the default
        VF->>LLM: claude-sonnet-5
        LLM-->>VF: semantic flags, optional question
    end
    VF-->>ORC: proceed, flags, or 2 hypotheses

    ORC->>RS: run per hypothesis
    Note over RS: enumerate, ladder, tier, score, select<br/>annotating, never deleting
    RS-->>ORC: offers, rationales, funnel, ledger

    alt hypotheses give different top 3
        ORC-->>UI: one clarifying question, 2 answer chips
        UI->>ORC: operator answers
    end

    ORC->>XP: render 3 rationales in one call
    Note over XP: the template is ALWAYS computed first,<br/>so a sentence exists whatever happens next
    XP->>LLM: claude-sonnet-5, one batched call
    LLM-->>XP: 3 sentences
    XP->>XP: faithfulness gate, per sentence
    Note over XP: any of 7 checks fails and the template stands,<br/>silently to the operator, logged as gate_fired
    XP-->>ORC: 3 reason lines

    ORC->>TS: spans closed, DecisionRecord written
    ORC-->>UI: three explained offers, funnel, ledger, counterfactual
